@Flowy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### 설비별,상태별 총 체류시간과 진입 횟수
GET {{Flowy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/state-dwell
Accept: application/json

### 설비별 Error 체류시간 (DB 기반 누적 병목 판정용)
GET {{Flowy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/error-bottleneck
Accept: application/json

### 설비별 누적 가동률 (시간 가중)
GET {{Flowy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/cumulative-availability
Accept: application/json
